      "description": "A single `tick 700` step silently under-runs: a random event can fire mid-batch and the tick command stops advancing right there (`Advanced N of 700 requested ticks`) rather than queuing the remainder, and `tick` itself refuses to advance at all while an event is pending. Chunked into 14\u00d7 (tick 50, event choose 0) instead, the same pattern already used everywhere else in this file's sibling scenarios, so no requested ticks are silently dropped waiting on an unresolved dialog."
